Package: excalidrawer
Title: Excalidraw-Style Charts, Drawings and Slides from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Joseph S.", "Miller", , "jossammil@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build, read and write 'Excalidraw' scenes from R, turn 'ggplot2'
    and base graphics into editable hand-drawn drawings, and render them
    offline with the same 'rough.js' engine and handwriting fonts that
    'Excalidraw' uses. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Excalidraw.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
